<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<div style="text-align: center;"><b style=""><font style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);" size="4" color="#006600">**EMBARQUE COLOCADO**</font></b></div>]]></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" height="300" >
<td tEditID="c1r2" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r2" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<font face="arial" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Estimado Equipo este Shipment</span></font><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp;ha sido asignado a Uds. para su </span><b style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">Verificación</b><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">.</span><div style=""><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style=""><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><b style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">Favor de confirmar </b><font face="arial"><b>Recepción</b></font><b style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp;de esta Solicitud y continuar con el seguimiento.</b></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style=""><font face="arial" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Estatus actual:&nbsp;</span></font><font color="#006600" face="arial"><b>{!Shipment__c.Shipment_Status_Plann__c}</b></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font color="#ff0000"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Shipment:&nbsp;</span><b>{!Shipment__c.Name}</b></font></div></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Cliente:&nbsp;</span><b>{!Shipment__c.Account_for_Customer_Name__c}</b></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><div style=""><font face="arial"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Route:</span><b>{!Shipment__c.Route__c}</b></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">Carrier: <b>{!Shipment__c.Carrier__c}</b></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">Aduana:&nbsp;{!Shipment__c.Border__c},&nbsp;{!Shipment__c.Customs__c}</div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><u><b>Nota:</b> Si Proveedor requiere Antcipo favor de proceder.</u></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><b>Comentarios:</b>&nbsp;</font><font face="arial">{!Shipment__c.Status_Observations__c}</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: medium;">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial" style=""><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div></div></div>]]></td>
</tr>
